    "sentence_translations": [
      "(1) Phone",
      "",
      "Little Dong is 8 years old. His dad is a doctor, and his mom is a teacher.",
      "Little Dong’s dad is very busy. Little Dong’s mom is also very busy.",
      "Little Dong often reads alone, eats alone, watches TV alone, and sleeps alone.",
      "",
      "Today is Wednesday. Little Dong is at home waiting for his mom. At 8 pm, his mom still hadn’t returned home.",
      "Little Dong’s mom works at a school. All the students call her Teacher Gao.",
      "Little Dong called his mom’s cell phone, but nobody answered. Little Dong thought, Mom’s school has a phone.",
      "The number is 0317652? 653?",
      "",
      "0317652, Little Dong dialed.",
      "",
      "“Hello? Hello,” an old person said.",
      "",
      "“H … hello. Is Teacher Gao there?” Little Dong said.",
      "",
      "“Teacher Gao? There is no Teacher Gao here. You called the wrong number,” the old person said.",
      "",
      "“Sorry …” Little Dong said.",
      "",
      "“No problem, good …” the old person wanted to say goodbye to Little Dong."
